    {
      "id": "5cf134d7-b288-4d1f-ba86-222cd6e4e95f",
      "name": "Sticky Note 22a7908a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1148,
        "height": 804,
        "content": "# Find LinkedIn posts by topic and turn their comments and likes into leads with Periodix Actions and AI\n\nGive it a topic, not a post URL. This workflow searches LinkedIn for posts on your topic through the Periodix Actions node, \npulls every reactor and commenter across all matching posts, scores each one against your ICP with AI, drafts a personalized connection note \nthat references the actual post, and logs everything to Google Sheets.\n\n### How it works\n1. Periodix Actions searches LinkedIn for posts matching your topic keywords.\n2. For each matching post, Periodix Actions fetches its reactions and comments.\n3. Everyone who engaged is normalized, deduped across all posts, and pre-filtered by ICP keywords.\n4. AI scores each engager 1 to 10 and writes a connection note referencing the specific post for anyone above your threshold.\n5. Hot leads go to the Hot tab, the rest to Cold with the score and reason.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the Periodix Actions node: a verified n8n community node for LinkedIn and Sales Navigator that works on both n8n Cloud and self-hosted. \nSign up at actions.periodix.net and connect a LinkedIn profile.\n2. Fill Campaign Config: topic keywords, ICP keywords, ICP description, offer, and score threshold.\n3. Add your AI provider key to the AI node (Claude, OpenAI, or Gemini all work).\n4. Connect your Google Sheet with Hot and Cold tabs.\n\nBuilt with: Periodix Actions. Free trial available. Search results start at $10/1,000, unlimited from $49/month.\n\n### Customization\nUnlike tools that need a specific post pasted in by hand, or that only watch mentions of your own brand, this searches any topics you choose across many posts at once (up to posts_limit per run), so outreach volume scales with how many relevant conversations are happening, not with how many post URLs you can find yourself. Periodix Actions connects through LinkedIn's own infra, not a browser scraper: no cookies, no CAPTCHA, no scraper fingerprint to trip detection. \nBuilt on Periodix's infrastructure (rated 4.9/5 on G2), at 5 to 18 times lower cost than a comparable Clay / Apollo or Apify setup."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
